# Authentication policies and system 
option 1: Local Authentication
- Email-based registration and login
- PBKDF2-SHA256 password hashing (200,000 iterations)
- Password complexity requirements (min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 special char)
- 90-day password expiration policy
- Account lockout after failed attempts (5 per user, 12 global)
option 2: Google OAuth 2.0 Integration
- Sign in with Google
- Automatic account creation or linking
- Profile picture synchronization
- Seamless authentication flow
option 3: Role-Based Access Control
- Admin: Full system access including database management
- Manager: Standard features access
- Viewer: Read-only consumption tracking

# Usage Guide
1. Sign Up / Login
Sign Up: 
Go to the "Sign up" tab
Enter a valid email address
Create a password (min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 special char)
Select a role (Viewer/Manager/Admin)
Click "Register"
Login:
Option 1: Enter email and password
Option 2: Click "Continue with Google"
2. Upload an Item
Click "Upload item" in the sidebar
Choose image: Upload from gallery, OR Take a photo with camera
Upload label (optional):
Add label photo for better data extraction
Use AI autocomplete for suggestions
Review & edit information: Brand, title, price, Country of origin, Material & category, View CO₂ estimate
Click "Confirm and continue"
3. Find Second-Hand Alternatives
After uploading an item:
Click "Yes, find alternatives"
Use marketplace quick links (Vinted, Wallapop, etc.)
Add estimated alternatives with price slider
Items are added to your cart
4. Manage Shopping Cart
Go to "Cart" in sidebar
For each item, select an action:
Bought the original: Records negative action
Saved the money: Records positive action (savings = full price)
Bought second-hand: Records positive action (savings = price difference)
Click "Confirm" to save
5. View Metrics
Go to "Metrics" in sidebar
Economic tab:
Total savings
Original spend
Detailed action history
Environmental tab:
CO₂ avoided
CO₂ generated
Item-level footprint
6. Use AI Chatbot
Go to "Chatbot" in sidebar
View your current data summary
Select:
Domain: Economic or Sustainable
Tone: Precise or Creative
Write your concern (optional)
Choose action:
Analyze: Get tailored recommendations
Action Plan: Get 7-day actionable plan
Keywords: Get relevant keywords
Send concern: Same as Analyze
Examples:
"I overspend on clothes; I want to reduce €100/month"
"Greener alternatives for basics (e.g., T-shirts)"
"How can I start a simple student budget?"
7. Admin Functions
Admin users only:
Go to "Admin" in sidebar
View all users and items
Export data as CSV
See database file path

